          "N/A"
        ],
        [
          "**Relay target interface**",
          "`docs/governance/delegate-fleet-orchestration.md` (fleet spawn planner)"
        ],
        [
          "**Port status**",
          "`superseded-by-relay-native`"
        ],
        [
          "**Risks**",
          "Rig Relay has its own spawn/fleet planner doctrine. Worktree isolation (pattern #5) is a future enabler for safe parallel execution"
        ],
        [
          "**Recommended slice**",
          "N/A — Rig Relay's spawn planner is independent"
        ]
